      "note": "The community-goal Fragment Cannon. Its authored clip multiplier is 1.6667, so the clip computes as 3 × 2.6667 = 8.0001 and the article holds 8 — the case that shows a stated multiplier's own precision must be snapped before an engineered clip is rounded up to a whole burst, or the noise buys a whole extra burst. Its reserve computes as 180 × 1.67776 = 301.9968 and rounds to 302."
